{
  "info": {
    "title": "Demo Student API",
    "summary": "API for managing students grades and attendence to demonstrate fine grained access control and business rules in a declarative way with JSON Schema",
    "description": "<h1>Access control</h1>\n<p>There are three different roles in this API.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Role/Permission name</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>admin</code></td>\n<td>is allowed to do everything that the API allows</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>teacher</code></td>\n<td>is allowed to update grade and attendence of his/her students</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>student</code></td>\n<td>is allowed to update email of himself/herself</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Api keys are used in this demo because it is an easy way to demonstrate authorization. Api keys which defined in <code>apiKeyGeneration</code> are generated if they are not present in database.</p>\n<p>Authentication mechanisms like OIDC or cookies can be used with the same athorization behavior as in the demo.</p>\n<h1>Business rules</h1>\n<p>Business rules are constraints for the transition from a current state of an existing entity to a new state of that entity.</p>\n<p>Current state in the case of a new entity (create with <code>POST</code>) is <code>null</code>. New state in the case of deleting an existing entity (<code>DELETE</code>) is <code>null</code>.</p>\n<p>In this demo API there is one business rule that only allows <code>grade</code> \"F\" for students with <code>attendencePercent</code> lower than <code>50</code>.</p>"
  },
  "x-dcentb": {
    "mongodb": {
      "db": "dcentb-demo"
    },
    "collections": {
      "students": {
        "permissions": {
          "student": {
            "readCollection": {
              "properties": {
                "description": "This is the 'items' property of the collection that is of type array (which is described by a keyword that is also called 'items' which contains the schema for every item in the array)",
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {}
                }
              }
            },
            "readItem": {
              "required": [
                "studentId"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "studentId": {
                  "const": {
                    "$data": "/authenticatedUser/studentId"
                  }
                },
                "meta": {
                  "properties": {
                    "etag": false
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "writeItem": {
              "properties": {
                "studentId": {
                  "const": {
                    "$data": "#/authenticatedUser/studentId"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "admin": {
            "readCollection": {},
            "readItem": {},
            "writeItem": {}
          },
          "teacher": {
            "readCollection": {
              "properties": {
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/x-dcentb/collections/students/permissions/teacher/readItem"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "readItem": {
              "required": [
                "teacherId"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "teacherId": {
                  "const": {
                    "$data": "#/authenticatedUser/teacherId"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "writeItem": {}
          }
        },
        "stateTransitionSchema": {
          "if": {
            "required": [
              "currentState"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "currentState": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "newState": {
                "properties": {
                  "studentId": {
                    "const": {
                      "$data": "/currentState/studentId"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "properties": {
            "newState": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "properties": {
                    "grade": {
                      "enum": [
                        "A",
                        "B",
                        "C",
                        "D",
                        "E"
                      ]
                    },
                    "attendancePercent": {
                      "minimum": 50
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "properties": {
                    "grade": {
                      "enum": [
                        "F"
                      ]
                    },
                    "attendancePercent": {
                      "minimum": 0
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "apiKeyGeneration": [
      {
        "userId": "teacher-A",
        "teacherId": "teacher-A",
        "permissions": [
          "teacher"
        ]
      },
      {
        "userId": "teacher-B",
        "teacherId": "teacher-B",
        "permissions": [
          "teacher"
        ]
      },
      {
        "studentId": "student-anna",
        "userId": "student-anna",
        "permissions": [
          "student"
        ]
      },
      {
        "studentId": "student-peter",
        "userId": "student-peter",
        "permissions": [
          "student"
        ]
      },
      {
        "studentId": "student-robert",
        "userId": "student-robert",
        "permissions": [
          "student"
        ]
      },
      {
        "userId": "admin-a1",
        "permissions": [
          "admin"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
